EnergyCommunity.core.controller

Scope & Responsibilities:
- Defines the public API contracts and service interfaces exposed by the backend core.
- Serves as the primary public entry point and communication boundary for all client applications (Mobile App, Admin App) and external consumers.
- Co-owned across backend capabilities (entity/device management, telemetry metrics, and action proposals).

Component Boundaries & Visibility:
- VISIBILITY: PUBLIC.
- Boundary Rule: All external callers must interact with the backend strictly through these contracts.
- Internal backend implementation details (database storage, internal calculation engines) are hidden behind this boundary.
